flowchart LR
  T["⊤ Thing"] --> Person & Vehicle & Bay & Zone
  Person --> Staff & Patient & Visitor & Supplier & BadgeHolder & ExpectantMother & ClearedPerson & BannedPerson
  Staff --> Doctor & Nurse & Paramedic & AdminOfficer & Clinician & OnShiftStaff
  Doctor --> OnCallDoctor
  Vehicle --> Car & Van & Motorcycle & EmergencyVehicle & AdmittedVehicle & TallVehicle & UnregisteredVehicle
  Car --> SUV & ElectricCar & PetrolCar
  ElectricCar --> LowBatteryEV
  Van --> WheelchairVan & Ambulance
  Bay --> AmbulanceBay & AccessibleBay & ChargerBay & LoadingBay & DropOffBay & StandardBay & FamilyBay & ClosedBay
  Zone --> GroundZone & UpperZone
  ClearedPerson x--x|disjoint| BannedPerson
  ElectricCar x--x|disjoint| PetrolCar
  GroundZone x--x|disjoint| UpperZone
